# CODEOWNERS — paths requiring a named reviewer before merge.
# See https://docs.github.com/articles/about-code-owners
#
# This repository holds the escrow orchestration, the OAuth token encryption
# and the payout logic, so every path has an owner; the entries below the
# catch-all call out the money and auth paths explicitly so they stay owned
# even if the catch-all is later narrowed. Takes effect once "Require review
# from Code Owners" is enabled in branch protection for main.

* @chonilius

# Money path: escrow, Soroban invocation, payouts, idempotency.
/src/escrow/            @chonilius
/src/bounties/          @chonilius
/src/milestones/        @chonilius
/src/maintenance-pool/  @chonilius
/src/teams/             @chonilius
/src/common/idempotency/ @chonilius

# Auth, secrets and configuration.
/src/auth/              @chonilius
/src/config/            @chonilius
/src/main.ts            @chonilius
/src/app.module.ts      @chonilius

# Schema and supply chain.
/src/database/          @chonilius
/package.json           @chonilius
/package-lock.json      @chonilius
/Dockerfile             @chonilius
/.github/               @chonilius
